lass="mt-1 text-lg font-semibold tabular-nums text-foreground">46 <span class="text-xs font-normal text-muted-foreground">ккал / 100 мл</span></dd></div></dl><p class="rounded-xl border border-border bg-muted/70 px-3 py-2.5 text-xs leading-5 text-muted-foreground">Видимое сбраживание: 65–80% — нормально для большинства элей.</p></div></div></aside><button type="button" class="inline-flex w-full items-center justify-center gap-1.5 rounded-lg border border-border bg-card px-3 py-2 text-xs font-medium text-muted-foreground transition-colors hover:border-border hover:bg-accent hover:text-foreground"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-link2 h-3.5 w-3.5"><path d="M9 17H7A5 5 0 0 1 7 7h2"></path><path d="M15 7h2a5 5 0 1 1 0 10h-2"></path><line x1="8" x2="16" y1="12" y2="12"></line></svg>Скопировать ссылку на расчёт</button></div></div><section class="rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card p-4 shadow-sm"><h2 class="text-sm font-semibold text-foreground">Дальше</h2><div class="mt-3 flex flex-wrap gap-2"><a class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-lg border border-border bg-card px-3 py-2 text-xs font-medium text-muted-foreground transition-colors hover:border-border hover:bg-muted" href="/calculators/priming-sugar">Карбонизация сахаром<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-right h-3.5 w-3.5"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"></path></svg></a><a class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-lg border border-border bg-card px-3 py-2 text-xs font-medium text-muted-foreground transition-colors hover:border-border hover:bg-muted" href="/calculators/keg-carbonation">Карбонизация в кеге<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-right h-3.5 w-3.5"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"></path></svg></a><a class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-lg border border-border bg-card px-3 py-2 text-xs font-medium text-muted-foreground transition-colors hover:border-border hover:bg-muted" href="/calculators/refractometer-correction">Поправка рефрактометра<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-right h-3.5 w-3.5"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"></path></svg></a><a class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-lg border border-border bg-card px-3 py-2 text-xs font-medium text-muted-foreground transition-colors hover:border-border hover:bg-muted" href="/calculators/hydrometer-correction">Поправка ареометра<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-right h-3.5 w-3.5"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"></path></svg></a><a class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-lg border border-border bg-card px-3 py-2 text-xs font-medium text-muted-foreground transition-colors hover:border-border hover:bg-muted" href="/calculators/brewhouse-efficiency">Эффективность<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-right h-3.5 w-3.5"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"></path></svg></a><a class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-lg border border-border bg-card px-3 py-2 text-xs font-medium text-muted-foreground transition-colors hover:border-border hover:bg-muted" href="/recipes">Рецепты сообщества<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-right h-3.5 w-3.5"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"></path></svg></a></div></section><details class="group rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card p-4 shadow-sm"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center gap-2 text-sm font-semibold text-foreground"><div class="flex h-7 w-7 items-center justify-center rounded-md bg-muted"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-right h-4 w-4 text-muted-foreground transition-transform group-open:rotate-90"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"></path></svg></div>Как считаем?<span class="ml-auto flex h-5 w-5 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-muted text-[11px] font-semibold text-muted-foreground">?</span></summary><div class="mt-3 space-y-2"><p class="text-sm leading-6 text-muted-foreground">ABV ≈ (OG − FG) × 131,25. Альтернативная формула точнее для крепкого пива — вносит поправку на плотность спирта.</p><p class="text-sm leading-6 text-muted-foreground">ABV показывает объёмную долю спирта.</p><p class="text-sm leading-6 text-muted-foreground">Видимое сбраживание помогает понять, насколько глубоко дрожжи переработали сусло.</p><div class="pt-1"><p class="text-xs font-medium text-muted-foreground">Допущения</p><ul class="mt-1 list-disc space-y-1 pl-4"><li class="text-xs leading-5 text-muted-foreground">Калькулятор даёт практическую оценку для домашнего пивоварения, а не лабораторную точность.</li><li class="text-xs leading-5 text-muted-foreground">Перед тем как переносить цифры в рецепт или журнал варки, проверьте единицы измерения.</li></ul></div></div></details><details class="group rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card p-4 shadow-sm"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center gap-2 text-sm font-semibold text-foreground"><div class="flex h-7 w-7 items-center justify-center rounded-md bg-muted"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-right h-4 w-4 text-muted-foreground transition-transform group-open:rotate-90"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"></path></svg></div>Частые ошибки</summary><ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-4"><li class="text-sm leading-6 text-muted-foreground">FG снята рефрактометром без поправки на спирт — ABV получится заниженным. Сначала пересчитайте показание в калькуляторе поправки рефрактометра.</li></ul></details></main><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"BreadcrumbList","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"name":"Главная","item":"http://localhost:3000"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"name":"Калькуляторы","item":"http://localhost:3000/calculators"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":3,"name":"Крепость и сбраживание","item":"http://localhost:3000/calculators/abv-attenuation"}]}</script><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"WebApplication","name":"Калькулятор ABV — крепость, сбраживание и калории","url":"http://localhost:3000/calculators/abv-attenuation","description":"Считает крепость пива (ABV и ABW), степень сбраживания и калорийность порции по начальной и конечной плотности (OG и FG) — по стандартной формуле или уточнённой для крепкого пива.","applicationCategory":"UtilityApplication","operatingSystem":"Web","inLanguage":"ru","isAccessibleForFree":true,"offers":{"@type":"Offer","price":"0","priceCurrency":"RUB"}}</script><div role="region" aria-label="Notifications (F8)" tabindex="-1" style="pointer-events:none"><ol tabindex="-1" class="fixed bottom-[calc(1rem+var(--nb-cookie-banner-h,0px)+var(--nb-bottom-nav-h,0px)+var(--nb-sticky-ba